  "recipe": "version_B's training recipe with exactly two changes: (1) --refusal-file swaps the one-line REFUSAL_RESPONSES for 520 extended refusals (overview -> explicit refusal -> ethical rationale, mean 143.8 words), (2) every adversarial term off (--lambda-gib 0 --stage2-lambda-gib 0 --lambda-uncensor 0). No attack simulation, no inner loop.",
